  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nDuring your Main Phase: You can send 1 \"Performage\"
    Pendulum Monster from your face-up Extra Deck to the GY, then you can increase
    this card's Pendulum Scale by that sent monster's. You can only use this effect
    of \"Performage Ball Balancer\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you
    control a \"Performage\" monster: You can Special Summon this card from your
    hand. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can activate 1 of these
    effects;\r\n\u25CF Add 1 \"Performage\" Pendulum Monster from your Deck to your
    face-up Extra Deck.\r\n\u25CF Destroy 1 \"Performage\" Monster Card you control.\r\nWhen
    an opponent's Special Summoned monster declares a direct attack: You can Special
    Summon this card from your GY. You can only use each effect of \"Performage Ball
    Balancer\" once per turn."
